  dialogues:
  - name: Dicehand Reno
    sentences:
    - Hi there! Is there anything to help you?
  - name: Dicehand Reno
    sentences:
    - Buy something then maybe I can give you a hint related to your adventure.
  - name: Dicehand Reno
    sentences:
    - 'Today is not your day. Unlucky at cards, lucky in love. Come again when you
      have funds. '
  - name: Dicehand Reno
    sentences:
    - Today you are lucky!
  - name: Dicehand Reno
    sentences:
    - Sorry, you don't have enough coins to make a bet.
